  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4803.01 General Requirements for CO2 Allowance Auctions",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4803.01 General Requirements for CO2 Allowance Auctions.\n\n(a) Upon allocation of CO2 allowances into the NHAA, the department shall participate in or conduct CO2 allowance auctions to sell such allowances pursuant to this chapter.\n\n(b) The auctions shall be conducted at such time and manner as determined by the department, in consultation with the regional organization.\n\n(c) The auctions shall be conducted as a single-round sealed-bid uniform price auction.\n\nSource. #9284, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9445, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10470, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13974, eff 5-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4800.html"
